  "post_content": "<p>Los ni&ntilde;os y las ni&ntilde;as de Ribesalbes, el &uacute;nico pueblo de la comarca&nbsp; que cuenta con centtro de educaci&oacute;n infantil y primaria (CEIP) propio, celebraron ayer jueves la fiestas de Navidad previa a las vacaciones invernales.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2011/12/IMG_7460.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La fiesta se celebr&oacute; en el edificio socicocultural y hubo villancicos, adem&aacute;s de otras representaciones.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festanadalcoleribesalbes/img_7358.jpg\" alt=\"img_7358\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festanadalcoleribesalbes/img_7378.jpg\" alt=\"img_7378\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festanadalcoleribesalbes/img_7387.jpg\" alt=\"img_7387\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festanadalcoleribesalbes/img_7401.jpg\" alt=\"img_7401\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festanadalcoleribesalbes/img_7410.jpg\" alt=\"img_7410\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festanadalcoleribesalbes/img_7428.jpg\" alt=\"img_7428\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festanadalcoleribesalbes/img_7457.jpg\" alt=\"img_7457\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festanadalcoleribesalbes/img_7460.jpg\" alt=\"img_7460\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
